---

## 📊 Key Business Questions

The project answers practical business questions such as:

### Sales Analysis

- What are the top-performing products by revenue?
- Which products have the highest quantity sold?
- What is the monthly revenue?
- What is the quarterly revenue?
- Which category generates the highest revenue?
- Which suppliers generate the highest revenue?

### Inventory Analysis

- Which products need to be reordered?
- Which products are out of stock?
- What is the inventory value of each product?
- Which category has the highest inventory value?
- Which products have low stock but high revenue?
- How many days has it been since inventory was updated?

### Product Performance

- Which products generate revenue above the average?
- Which products sell more than the average quantity?
- Which product has the highest revenue in each category?
- Which product has the highest quantity sold in each category?

---

## 🔎 Example SQL Analysis

### Top 5 Products by Revenue

```sql
SELECT 
    p.product_id,
    p.product_name,
    p.category,
    SUM(s.sales_amount) AS total_revenue
FROM products p
JOIN sales s 
    ON p.product_id = s.product_id
GROUP BY 
    p.product_id,
    p.product_name,
    p.category
ORDER BY total_revenue DESC
LIMIT 5;
